    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=0$.\n\nRecognise $(2^x-3^x)^2=0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2^x)^2-2(2^x)(3^x)+(3^x)^2&=0\\\\(2^x-3^x)^2&=0\\\\2^x&=3^x\\\\\\left(\\frac23\\right)^x&=1\\\\x&=0.\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $1+1=2\\times1$.",
